=== Deadlock Detection (RAG) ===

--- Scenario 1: No Deadlock ---
Wait-for Graph Edges:
P0 -> P1
No deadlock detected. Wait-for graph is acyclic.

--- Scenario 2: Deadlock (3-Process Circular Wait) ---
Wait-for Graph Edges:
P0 -> P1
P1 -> P2
P2 -> P0
Deadlock Detected! Cycle: P0 -> P1 -> P2 -> P0 -> P0
